{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1537056000, "end_date": 1537747199, "month_true_total": 246, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:18:42 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "44901503", "author": {"steamid": "76561198298560673", "personaname": "Finn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/finn223/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 4646, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 524, "last_played": 1756129853, "avatar": "5f6a0230dae81c5a65a906f19413c0dffe07a7b0"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is hands down one of, if not THE best co-op game available on Steam. The game is extremely fun and addictive, and it knows how to reward players for cooperation. If you can get past the fact that there are no dedicated servers and tthe game relies on P2P, it is a must-have for Co-op fans.", "timestamp_created": 1537737803, "timestamp_updated": 1537737803, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 12, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "44899025", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114107381", "personaname": "Thalgreath", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Thalgreath/", "num_games_owned": 726, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 6751, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1297, "last_played": 1712683039, "avatar": "4497defbee38c96e09557c6ee8f508d2c07ff4be"}, "language": "english", "review": "ROCK AND STONE BROTHERS", "timestamp_created": 1537728443, "timestamp_updated": 1537728443, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44898991", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049087311", "personaname": "Huliwillie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049087311/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3613, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 323, "last_played": 1748099587, "avatar": "eca2b9009232a20fd32019920817db7fd9aa4d7a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rock and stone!", "timestamp_created": 1537728290, "timestamp_updated": 1537728290, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44896550", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028710124", "personaname": "Punchbag Bob⁴²", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028710124/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 141749, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 103744, "last_played": 1764355988, "avatar": "bec88464a6beaafaad674d4c41f4231499bfad43"}, "language": "english", "review": "used to be a good game. :(\nI really didnt mind much how with most gun options, there usually was 1 obvious choice that was best. but then they added a lot of time gated content, heavily involving RNG so getting the most out of your gun has been a matter of getting lucky and waiting a week IRL till you are allowed to try again ever since.\n\nsadly 2 years after they added time gated content, it still isn't common finding random teammates who have had good enough RNG to unlock said content, or teammates who have played for long enough to unlock all of it.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1537720328, "timestamp_updated": 1671767463, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476077079772949219", "comment_count": 6, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44892204", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970080475", "personaname": "FlibDobBob", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DumbHed/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 251, "playtime_forever": 798, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 562, "last_played": 1584829910, "avatar": "3e92d2edbab3b2c2a3b9023e90c5e005581faef1"}, "language": "english", "review": "OMG I absolutely love this game. It's amazing when playing with friends, the Dev's have released a road map with a list of updates and they are keeping to that roadmap.\n These Dev's are great and live up to their promises.\n\nThe RNG caves are really well done and you can go pretty much anywhere you like, as long as you don't mind digging :)\n\nMy only gripe is when you set the game to the harder difficulty levels; it's brutal, i mean you get totally OWNED - So many enemies and just not enough ammo/ armor.\n\nA campaign mode would be amazing; I think that's on the road map as kind of a stretch goal; I really hope they do it!\n\nSo yeah, if you play games with friends, then this is definitely worth a buy! :)", "timestamp_created": 1537706505, "timestamp_updated": 1537706505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}